      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-Btt9GbWYDOZYtIRc\"><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +11 to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. <em>Hit:</em> 40 (6d10 + 7) piercing damage plus 10 (3d6) fire damage. If the target is a creature, it is grappled (escape [[/check ability=str dc=17]]). Until this grapple ends, the target is restrained, and the remorhaz can't bite another target.</p></section><p>The remorhaz attacks with its Bite.  If the target is a creature, it is &amp;Reference[grappled]{grappled}. Until this grapple ends, the target is &amp;Reference[restrained]{restrained}.</p>",
